    "_doc": "Home cards (area and project) list their CHILDREN, never applications: one column per child with the rows card (in-page jump to the child's card), repo (hub repo, else the first repo) and webapp (only where the registry declares `webapp`); the node's registry `landing` URL is the large link at the bottom. Labels and icons live here, URLs come from the registry.",
