    "_doc": "cloudy-u-android apps (apk-manifest.json) grouped by category. Category order = the order of `categories`; an app not listed lands in OTHER. Label = `labels[name]`, else the name without its cloud- prefix, title-cased. URL = the cloud-web page when the manifest declares web.portal_slug, else the module folder on GitHub.",
